(7648306, 1243652, 124815, '<td valign="top">Majestically this kitchen scale is occupying perhaps too much of the composition. Personally I would have given it more empty space on top or paradoxically crowded with nuts of all kinds or rags the bottom. <br/>But all in all, a crisp image in the glory of a setting sun</td>', 'Majestically this kitchen scale is occupying perhaps too much of the composition. Personally I would have given it more empty space on top or paradoxically crowded with nuts of all kinds or rags the bottom. But all in all, a crisp image in the glory of a setting sun', '2019-12-14 01:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
