(7648317, 1243609, 173844, '<td valign="top">A wonderful title, as this is, rounds out the image, brings out the mood and elicits a thoughtful meditation on just what is going on here.  I feel it but can''t quite put my finger on it.  And blue''s magic is in full blossom.  I''d like to wallpaper a room with this.  The duck in the lower right corner is a charming grace note. <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A wonderful title, as this is, rounds out the image, brings out the mood and elicits a thoughtful meditation on just what is going on here.  I feel it but can''t quite put my finger on it.  And blue''s magic is in full blossom.  I''d like to wallpaper a room with this.  The duck in the lower right corner is a charming grace note. Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2019-12-14 11:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648320, 1243600, 124815, '<td valign="top">Why do I think of Deb when I look at this? <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> Because of a camouflaged tenderness? the picture looks as if the photographer placed mentally some of the people that she loves on the same beach, young and older, small or taller<br/> <br/>Should have been 10 but I dislike too much the border</td>', 'Why do I think of Deb when I look at this?  Melethia Because of a camouflaged tenderness? the picture looks as if the photographer placed mentally some of the people that she loves on the same beach, young and older, small or taller Should have been 10 but I dislike too much the border', '2019-12-14 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
