(7648461, 1243600, 173844, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Not only are the children balancing themselves, the people overall are nicely positioned.  As are sky, water and land.  And it''s interesting how strong silhouettes can also feel ethereal.  Most framing doesn''t appeal to me, but this one works, a postcard capturing the moment and sent off to a friend.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Not only are the children balancing themselves, the people overall are nicely positioned.  As are sky, water and land.  And it''s interesting how strong silhouettes can also feel ethereal.  Most framing doesn''t appeal to me, but this one works, a postcard capturing the moment and sent off to a friend.', '2019-12-16 08:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7648462, 1243643, 173844, '<td valign="top">The balancing-est image in the challenge.  Nice find.</td>', 'The balancing-est image in the challenge.  Nice find.', '2019-12-16 08:39:16.000000', NULL, 0),
